#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1801
msgid "El centro del parque cierra al mediodía."
msgstr "The park centre closes at midday."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1802
msgid "Use repelente y protección solar."
msgstr "Use repellent and sunscreen."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1804
msgid ""
"El humedal más importante de Costa Rica y sede del Santuario de Aves "
"Migratorias de Palmar Chico."
msgstr ""
"The most important wetland in Costa Rica and home to the Palmar Chico "
"Migratory Bird Sanctuary."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1811
msgid ""
"La isla del tesoro: 550 km mar adentro, Patrimonio de la Humanidad y paraíso "
"de tiburones."
msgstr ""
"The treasure island: 550 km offshore, a World Heritage Site and a shark "
"paradise."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1814
msgid ""
"Está a 550 km del continente y solo se llega en barco (36 h) o tras vuelo "
"privado."
msgstr ""
"It lies 550 km from the mainland and is reached only by boat (36 h) or "
"private flight."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1815
msgid "Fue declarada Patrimonio de la Humanidad por la UNESCO en 1997."
msgstr "It was declared a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1997."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1816
msgid ""
"Sus aguas concentran tiburones martillo en cardúmenes, y se cree inspiración "
"de \"Jurassic Park\"."
msgstr ""
"Its waters gather hammerhead sharks in schools, and it is thought to have "
"inspired \"Jurassic Park\"."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1817
