msgstr "Bring your own supplies and diving gear"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1844
msgid ""
"Su protección como Reserva Biológica y Patrimonio de la Humanidad es uno de "
"los mayores logros de conservación marina del país."
msgstr ""
"Its protection as a Biological Reserve and World Heritage Site is one of the "
"country's greatest marine conservation achievements."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1851
