#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1854
msgid ""
"Protege uno de los pocos bosques de cativo y un manglar de importancia "
"regional."
msgstr ""
"It protects one of the few cativo forests and a mangrove of regional "
"importance."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1855
msgid ""
"Es sitio de anidación de tortuga baula (Dermochelys coriacea) y tortuga "
