msgstr "Puntarenas"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1938
msgid "Bosque nuboso húmedo de montaña"
msgstr "Montane humid cloud forest"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1939
msgid "1.530-1.800 msnm"
msgstr "1,530-1,800 masl"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1940
msgid "Diciembre a abril para las aves migratorias"
msgstr "December to April for migratory birds"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1941
msgid ""
"Su creación en 1983 evitó la tala de un bosque que hoy alimenta a los "
"cafetales de la zona; sigue siendo el mayor esfuerzo de conservación privada "
"de bosque nuboso del país."
msgstr ""
"Its creation in 1983 prevented the logging of a forest that now feeds the "
"coffee plantations of the area; it remains the country's largest private "
"cloud forest conservation effort."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1942
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2591
msgid ""
"El sendero principal tiene tablones y es transitable con ayuda; la niebla y "
"las escaleras limitan la movilidad autónoma."
msgstr ""
"The main trail has boardwalks and can be walked with assistance; the fog and "
"the stairs limit independent mobility."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1943
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2592
msgid "https://www.reservabosquedemonteverde.org/"
msgstr "https://www.reservabosquedemonteverde.org/"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1944
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2590
msgid ""
"El bosque nuboso de Monteverde se mantuvo a salvo casi por accidente: "
"cafetaleros sin un ingreso propio, junto con los conservacionistas, "
"aceptaron dejar áreas sin talar a cambio de agua. Hoy la reserva protege "
"1.600 hectáreas de bosque con neblina permanente, donde el quetzal y las "
"aves del dosel son la verdadera atracción. Las pasarelas de tablones "
"permiten entrar sin pisar el suelo, algo poco habitual en un bosque tan "
"húmedo."
msgstr ""
"Monteverde's cloud forest was saved almost by accident: coffee growers with "
"no income of their own, together with conservationists, agreed to leave "
"areas unlogged in exchange for water. Today the reserve protects 1,600 "
"hectares of forest with permanent mist, where the quetzal and the canopy "
"birds are the real attraction. The boardwalk walkways let you enter without "
"stepping on the ground, something unusual in such a humid forest."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1951
msgid "El primer parque nacional del país, con el mayor manglar del Pacífico."
msgstr ""
"The country's first national park, with the largest mangrove on the Pacific."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1953
