msgstr "Its 1,000-hectare mangrove is the largest on the Pacific."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1955
msgid "En Matapalo se protege bosque seco, matorral y dunas costeras."
msgstr "Matapalo protects dry forest, scrub and coastal dunes."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1956
msgid "La playa de Nacascolo es punto de llegada de las tortugas verdes."
msgstr "Nacascolo Beach is an arrival point for green turtles."

