#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1986
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2595
msgid ""
"El parque abrió en 1955 y fue la primera área protegida del país. Hoy "
"protege bosque seco, el mayor manglar del Pacífico y la playa de Nacascolo. "
"En julio llegan tortugas verdes a desovar en la costa."
msgstr ""
"The park opened in 1955 and was the country's first protected area. Today it "
"protects dry forest, the largest mangrove on the Pacific and Nacascolo "
"Beach. In July green turtles come to nest along the coast."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1993
msgid ""
"Aguas termales a los pies del Arenal, café de altura y el volcán de fondo."
msgstr ""
"Hot springs at the foot of Arenal, highland coffee and the volcano on the "
"backdrop."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1995
msgid "Las termas reciben agua de 60 a 100 grados de fuentes volcánicas."
msgstr "The hot springs draw water at 60 to 100 degrees from volcanic sources."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1996
msgid "El pueblo está en la base norte del Volcán Arenal, a 20 km del cono."
msgstr "The town sits at the north base of Volcán Arenal, 20 km from the cone."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1997
msgid "La zona cafétera produce café de altura de gran calidad."
msgstr "The coffee zone produces high-quality highland coffee."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1998
msgid "Es punto de partida hacia el Arenal, el Río Celeste y Lomas Barbudal."
msgstr "It is the starting point for Arenal, Río Celeste and Lomas Barbudal."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2001
msgid "Tucanes, colibríes y tres especies de monos en los cerros"
msgstr "Toucans, hummingbirds and three monkey species in the hills"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2002
msgid "Aves migratorias que descansan en la zona durante sus viajes"
msgstr "Migratory birds that rest in the area during their journeys"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2003
msgid "Arañas, escarabajos y moluscos de humedad tropical"
msgstr "Spiders, beetles and moisture-loving tropical mollusks"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2004
msgid "Bosque ribereño con aves acuáticas en el Río San Carlos"
msgstr "Riparian forest with waterbirds on the Río San Carlos"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2007
msgid "Baño en las termas naturales"
msgstr "Soak in the natural hot springs"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2008
msgid "Visita una plantación de café con cata"
msgstr "Visit a coffee plantation with tasting"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2009
msgid "Paseos en bote por el Lago Arenal al atardecer"
msgstr "Boat rides on Lago Arenal at sunset"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2010
msgid "Caminatas nocturnas con guía en los senderos del cono"
msgstr "Night walks with a guide on the cone trails"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2013
msgid "Lleve traje de baño y toalla: hay taquillas y duchas con agua caliente."
msgstr ""
"Bring a swimsuit and a towel: there are changing rooms and hot water showers."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2014
msgid ""
"El acceso a las termas es libre; se paga solo el uso de las instalaciones."
msgstr ""
"Access to the hot springs is free; only use of the facilities is charged."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2015
msgid "Use repelente en el bosque: los senderos son cortos y hay garrapatas."
msgstr ""
"Use insect repellent in the forest: the trails are short and there are ticks."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2017
msgid "Termas abiertas todos los días, de 8:00 a 21:00"
msgstr "Hot springs open every day, 8:00 to 21:00"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2018
msgid "Termas: desde $12 extranjeros / 4.000 colones nacionales"
msgstr "Hot springs: from $12 for foreigners / 4,000 colones for nationals"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2019
msgid "Zona de termas de unas 3 hectáreas"
msgstr "Hot springs area of about 3 hectares"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2020
msgid "1913"
msgstr "1913"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2022
msgid "Bosque premontano, campos de café y fuentes geotérmicas"
msgstr "Premontane forest, coffee fields and geothermal springs"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2023
msgid "340 msnm"
msgstr "340 masl"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2024
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2066
msgid "Diciembre a abril y julio a agosto"
msgstr "December to April and July to August"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2025
msgid ""
"Las fuentes termales nacen del mismo sistema volcánico que alimenta el "
"Arenal; su uso se regula para evitar el sobreconsumo de agua."
msgstr ""
"The hot springs come from the same volcanic system that feeds Arenal; their "
"use is regulated to avoid overusing the water."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2026
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2601
msgid ""
"Las termas tienen plataformas y acceso por rampa; los senderos naturales no "
"son accesibles en silla de ruedas."
msgstr ""
"The hot springs have platforms and ramp access; the natural trails are not "
"wheelchair accessible."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2028
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2600
msgid ""
"La Fortuna creció alrededor de las fuentes termales que afloran en la falda "
"del Arenal y hoy es el punto de partida más usado de la Zona Norte. A veinte "
"kilómetros del cono, el pueblo combina el volcán de fondo con restaurantes y "
"la salida diaria de los tours hacia el parque nacional, el Río Celeste y las "
"senderas de Lomas Barbudal."
msgstr ""
"La Fortuna grew around the hot springs that emerge on the slopes of Arenal "
"and is today the most used starting point of the Northern Zone. Twenty "
"kilometers from the cone, the town combines the volcano on the backdrop with "
"restaurants and the daily departure of tours to the national park, Río "
"Celeste and the Lomas Barbudal trails."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2035
msgid ""
"La playa más conocida de la península de Nicoya: surf, yoga y atardeceres "
"sobre el Pacífico."
msgstr ""
"The best-known beach on the Nicoya Peninsula: surf, yoga and sunsets over "
"the Pacific."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2037
msgid ""
