msgstr ""
"The lake and its riparian areas are part of the Guanacaste Conservation Area."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2110
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2611
msgid ""
"El pueblo es transitable a pie y el muelle es plano; los senderos del lago "
"no."
msgstr "The village is walkable and the dock is flat; the lake trails are not."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2112
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2610
msgid ""
"Nuevo Arenal se levantó de nuevo en 1990, cuando el embalse tapó el pueblo "
"viejo. Hoy vive del lago y ofrece los atardeceres más claros del norte del "
"país. Los botes salen al atardecer y el Observatorio Arenal queda a cinco "
"kilómetros."
msgstr ""
"Nuevo Arenal was built again in 1990, when the reservoir flooded the old "
"town. Today it lives off the lake and offers the clearest sunsets in the "
"north of the country. Boats leave at sunset and the Arenal Observatory is "
"five kilometers away."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2119
msgid ""
"Agua turquesa de minerales termales y una cascada dentro del parque Tenorio."
msgstr ""
"Turquoise thermal mineral water and a waterfall inside Tenorio National Park."

