"springs."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2152
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2616
msgid ""
"El sendero de 3 km tiene tierra y escalones, no es apto para sillas de "
"ruedas."
msgstr "The 3 km trail has dirt and steps, so it is not wheelchair accessible."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2154
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2615
msgid ""
"El Río Celeste nace del encuentro entre el Río Grande y el Río Pailas. Los "
"minerales termales dan el color turquesa a los tenideros. La caminata de 3 "
"km lleva a la cascada y cruza un puente."
msgstr ""
"Río Celeste is born where the Río Grande meets the Río Pailas. Thermal "
"minerals give the pools their turquoise color. The 3 km walk leads to the "
"waterfall and crosses a bridge."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2161
msgid ""
"Uno de los últimos bosques secos de Guanacaste y un gran refugio de aves."
msgstr "One of the last dry forests in Guanacaste and a great bird sanctuary."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2163
msgid "Se creó en 1991 junto con el área de conservación Guanacaste."
msgstr "It was created in 1991 along with the Guanacaste Conservation Area."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2164
