#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2190
msgid "Bosque seco tropical y galería de ribera"
msgstr "Tropical dry forest and riparian gallery"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2191
msgid "100-800 msnm"
msgstr "100-800 masl"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2192
msgid "Diciembre a abril y julio para las aves"
msgstr "December to April, and July for birds"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2193
msgid ""
"Protege uno de los últimos bosques secos de Guanacaste dentro de un corredor "
"biológico."
msgstr ""
"It protects one of the last dry forests of Guanacaste within a biological "
"corridor."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2194
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2621
msgid "Los senderos son de tierra y piedra, no hay acceso en silla de ruedas."
msgstr "The trails are dirt and stone, with no wheelchair access."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2196
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2620
msgid ""
"Lomas Barbudal protege uno de los últimos bosques secos de Guanacaste. Sus "
"senderos suben desde el suelo rojo hasta el mirador, con el bosque como "
"protagonista. Su lista de aves roza las 230 especies, la razón de muchas "
"visitas."
msgstr ""
"Lomas Barbudal protects one of the last dry forests in Guanacaste. Its "
"trails rise from the red soil up to the lookout, with the forest as the "
"star. Its bird list reaches nearly 230 species, which is why so many people "
"visit."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2203
msgid ""
"La primera reserva absoluta del país: bosque seco, costa rocosa y una playa "
"de tortugas."
msgstr ""
"The country's first absolute reserve: dry forest, rocky coast and a turtle "
"beach."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2205
msgid "Declarada en 1963, fue la primera reserva natural absoluta del país."
msgstr "Declared in 1963, it was the country's first absolute nature reserve."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2206
msgid "Cubre unas 7.800 hectáreas que incluyen el mar y el bosque seco."
msgstr "It covers some 7.800 hectares including the sea and the dry forest."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2207
msgid "En 1963 los Beatles nadaron en la playa que hoy protege las tortugas."
msgstr "In 1963 the Beatles swam at the beach that today protects the turtles."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2208
msgid ""
"El proyecto Ostional administra la reserva de tortugas marinas del sitio."
msgstr "The Ostional project manages the site's sea turtle reserve."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2211
msgid "Tortuga verde que anida en la playa de Cabo Blanco"
msgstr "Green turtle nesting on Cabo Blanco beach"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2212
msgid "Buhón blanco y negro en el bosque seco"
msgstr "Black-and-white hawk in the dry forest"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2213
msgid "Ara escarlata en parejas en el dosel"
msgstr "Scarlet macaw pairs in the canopy"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2214
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2507
msgid "Venado cola blanca en los claros del bosque"
msgstr "White-tailed deer in the forest clearings"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2217
msgid "Visita a la playa de anidación de tortugas"
msgstr "Visit to the turtle nesting beach"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2218
msgid "Caminata por el sendero costero"
msgstr "Walk along the coastal trail"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2219
msgid "Observación de aves al amanecer"
msgstr "Birdwatching at dawn"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2220
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2262
msgid "Snorkel en el arrecife"
msgstr "Snorkeling on the reef"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2223
msgid "Los senderos son cortos pero rocosos: lleve buen calzado."
msgstr "The trails are short but rocky: wear sturdy footwear."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2224
msgid "No hay servicios en la playa, lleve agua y protector solar."
msgstr "There are no services on the beach, bring water and sunscreen."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2225
msgid "Respete las zonas marcadas de anidación de las tortugas."
msgstr "Respect the marked turtle nesting zones."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2229
msgid "7.800 hectáreas, con el mar y el bosque"
msgstr "7.800 hectares, with the sea and the forest"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2230
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2566
msgid "1963"
msgstr "1963"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2232
msgid "Bosque seco tropical, costa rocosa y área marina"
msgstr "Tropical dry forest, rocky coast and marine area"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2234
msgid "Junio a noviembre para las tortugas"
msgstr "June to November for turtles"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2235
msgid ""
"Protege el bosque seco y la costa donde anidan tortugas verdes, con áreas "
"delimitadas para su protección."
msgstr ""
"It protects the dry forest and the coast where green turtles nest, with "
"delimited areas set aside for their protection."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2236
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2626
msgid ""
"Se llega por carretera y a pie; los senderos rocosos no admiten sillas de "
"ruedas."
msgstr ""
"Access is by road and on foot; the rocky trails do not accommodate "
"wheelchairs."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2238
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2625
msgid ""
"Cabo Blanco fue declarada reserva absoluta en 1963, la primera del país. Hoy "
"protege unas 7.800 hectáreas de bosque seco, costa rocosa y mar. La playa "
"donde nadaron los Beatles recibe tortugas verdes cada temporada."
msgstr ""
"Cabo Blanco was declared an absolute reserve in 1963, the first in the "
"country. Today it protects some 7.800 hectares of dry forest, rocky coast "
"and sea. The beach where the Beatles swam receives green turtles every "
"season."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2245
msgid ""
"El extremo más norte de la península de Nicoya, con acantilados y bosque "
"seco."
msgstr ""
"The northernmost tip of the Nicoya Peninsula, with cliffs and dry forest."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2247
msgid "Es el punto más septentrional de la península de Nicoya."
msgstr "It is the northernmost point of the Nicoya Peninsula."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2248
msgid "Rodean el cabo el bosque seco y los acantilados rocosos."
msgstr "Dry forest and rocky cliffs surround the cape."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2249
msgid "Desde el mirador se ve todo el Golfo de Papagayo."
msgstr "From the lookout you can see the whole Gulf of Papagayo."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2250
msgid "Cerca están los hoteles y las playas de Playa Nacascolo."
msgstr "The hotels and beaches of Playa Nacascolo are nearby."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2253
msgid "Fragata y pelicano pardo sobre la costa"
msgstr "Frigatebird and brown pelican over the coast"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2256
msgid "Aves playeras en la franja de arena"
msgstr "Shorebirds on the strip of sand"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2259
