msgstr "The trail is slippery when damp."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2393
msgid "No entre al río: la corriente es fuerte."
msgstr "Do not enter the river: the current is strong."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2397
msgid "42.000 hectáreas"
msgstr "42,000 hectares"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2398
msgid "1978"
msgstr "1978"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2399
msgid "Huetar Norte"
msgstr "North Huetar"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2400
msgid "Bosque húmedo tropical y cerros karsticos"
msgstr "Tropical rainforest and karst hills"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2401
msgid "60-1.174 msnm"
msgstr "60-1,174 masl"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2403
msgid ""
"Conserva la mayor mancha de selva primaria de las montanas centrales del "
"país."
msgstr ""
"It preserves the largest patch of primary forest in the country's central "
"mountains."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2404
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2646
msgid ""
"Los senderos son de tierra, con pendientes y raíces; no hay acceso en silla "
"de ruedas."
msgstr ""
"The trails are dirt paths, with slopes and roots; there is no wheelchair "
"access."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2406
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2645
msgid ""
"El parque protege una de las últimas manchas grandes de selva primaria del "
"país. El río Braulio Carrillo lo atraviesa y define el sector abierto a "
"visitas. El bosque conserva especies raras como la harpía y el ocelote."
msgstr ""
"The park protects one of the last large patches of primary forest in the "
"country. The Braulio Carrillo River runs through it and defines the sector "
"open to visitors. The forest holds rare species such as the harpy eagle and "
"the ocelot."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2413
msgid ""
"Bosque nuboso de las montañas volcánicas centrales con una gran población de "
"quetzal."
msgstr ""
"Cloud forest of the central volcanic mountains with a large quetzal "
"population."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2415
msgid ""
"Creado en 1982, protege el bosque más extenso de la sierra volcánica central."
msgstr ""
"Created in 1982, it protects the largest forest in the central volcanic "
"range."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2416
msgid "Su bosque de neblina alberga una de las mayores poblaciones de quetzal."
msgstr "Its cloud forest harbors one of the largest quetzal populations."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2417
msgid "El Mirador de la Gollita mira al valle y al dosel del bosque."
msgstr "Mirador de la Gollita looks out over the valley and the forest canopy."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2418
msgid "El Sendero del Quetzal une el parque con el valle de Savegre."
msgstr "The Quetzal Trail links the park with the Savegre Valley."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2421
msgid "Quetzal resplandeciente, la estrella del parque"
msgstr "Resplendent quetzal, the star of the park"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2422
msgid "Momoto resplandeciente en el dosel del bosque"
msgstr "Resplendent motmot in the forest canopy"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2423
msgid "Aves de seda y colibríes de la neblina"
msgstr "Silky flycatchers and cloud forest hummingbirds"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2424
msgid "Mono aullador y tapir de monte en el sotobosque"
msgstr "Howler monkey and tapir in the understory"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2427
msgid "Observación de quetzal con guía en el mirador"
msgstr "Guided quetzal watching at the viewpoint"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2428
msgid "Caminata por los senderos de la reserva"
msgstr "Walk along the reserve trails"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2429
msgid "Observación de aves en el Mirador de la Gollita"
msgstr "Birdwatching at Mirador de la Gollita"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2430
msgid "Visita a una finca de café en los alrededores"
msgstr "Visit to a coffee farm in the surrounding area"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2433
