msgstr "The trail to the quetzal viewpoint is muddy and slippery."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2434
msgid "Lleve agua y bocadillos: no hay servicios dentro."
msgstr "Bring water and snacks: there are no services inside."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2435
msgid "La puerta cierra a las 15:00, no después."
msgstr "The gate closes at 15:00, not later."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2438
msgid "Entrada: $5 extranjeros / 1.000 colones nacionales"
msgstr "Entry: $5 for foreigners / 1,000 colones for nationals"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2439
msgid "9.500 hectáreas"
msgstr "9,500 hectares"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2440
msgid "1982"
msgstr "1982"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2441
msgid "Cartago"
msgstr "Cartago"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2442
msgid "Bosque nuboso húmedo de la sierra volcánica central"
msgstr "Humid cloud forest of the central volcanic range"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2443
msgid "1.600-2.600 msnm"
msgstr "1,600-2,600 masl"

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2445
msgid ""
"Sostiene al quetzal y protege el bosque nuboso más extenso de la sierra "
"volcánica central."
msgstr ""
"It sustains the quetzal and protects the largest cloud forest in the central "
"volcanic range."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2446
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2651
msgid ""
"Los senderos son de tierra, con barro y pendientes; no hay acceso en silla "
"de ruedas."
msgstr ""
"The trails are dirt paths, with mud and slopes; there is no wheelchair "
"access."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2448
#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2650
msgid ""
"Tapantial protege el bosque nuboso más extenso de la sierra volcánica "
"central. El quetzal anida en el dosel y se observa con guía desde el "
"mirador. A las 15:00 cierra la puerta y el valle queda en silencio."
msgstr ""
"Tapantial protects the largest cloud forest in the central volcanic range. "
"The quetzal nests in the canopy and is seen with a guide from the viewpoint. "
"At 15:00 the gate closes and the valley falls silent."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2455
msgid ""
"El último gran tramo de bosque seco del Pacífico central, con el río "
"Tárcoles."
msgstr ""
"The last large stretch of dry forest in the central Pacific, with the "
"Tárcoles River."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2457
msgid ""
"Creado en 1995, protege la mayor extensión de bosque seco del Pacífico "
"central."
msgstr ""
"Created in 1995, it protects the largest area of dry forest in the central "
"Pacific."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2458
msgid "El río Tárcoles marca el límite norte del área protegida."
msgstr "The Tárcoles River marks the northern boundary of the protected area."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2459
msgid "El mirador de la Piedra Bola domina la selva y el valle."
msgstr "The Piedra Bola viewpoint overlooks the forest and the valley."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:2460
